//// The points the training creatures of Warfare Woods stand at, in the Novice
//// training simulation (World 3460): the 27 points where Jim's world database
//// (`spawn.tsv`, rows 29113 to 29139) stands a Virtual Battle Beast. The client
//// holds no spawn point, only the circle of each objective (WorldLocation2
//// 51739 for the Exile fight, 52898 for the Dominion one; fact `Quest2.10518`,
//// `Quest2.10524`), so these points are retail data the client lacks, marked
//// with their row (`genesis_prime/world_map/spawn`). All 27 lie inside the Exile
//// circle. The facing of a point is the database's rotation_x, rotation_y and
//// rotation_z read as yaw, pitch and roll, which is a reading, not the client's.

/// One point of the world database: its `spawn.tsv` row, its position and its
/// facing in radians.
pub type Point {
  Point(
    row_id: Int,
    x: Float,
    y: Float,
    z: Float,
    yaw: Float,
    pitch: Float,
    roll: Float,
  )
}

